{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1f74cf25b0157e0cf3c16e63aa8f0c6e4313075fa280b691f34c0705d9d0b856","ja":"静香、莉緒、瑞希の3人は、\nダンスレッスンの映像をチェックしていて……","zh":"静香、莉绪、瑞希3人，\n正在查看舞蹈练习的录像……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6dcacc34c6bb1de9d7721143e655532284a9eaf92f9eb284e1f9ca184e5eeb8d","ja":"かなりよくなったのではないでしょうか？\nレッスンの成果、バッチリだぞ。","zh":"感觉改善了不少呢？\n特训成果相当棒哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"4677549ac0827cf1b2f3770413049f33fdf5e3e4edec2e76bf34665e10e3c694","ja":"そうですね、ステップのズレも修正できましたし。\nあ、でも、最後にもう少し合わせたいです。","zh":"确实呢，舞步的偏差也调整过来了。\n啊，不过，最后那部分我还想再配合一下。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8d522194b46ac3775220bc92fa40e9ce052a344d24411e5ca3f28f1d9e8dc2f5","ja":"そうね。じゃあ、終わりも見えてきたことだし、\nいったん一息つきましょ♪","zh":"也是呢。既然快要结束了，\n那就先歇口气吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3299db328819bdd220ff8492fa939f9b848b78e29272ad9d33b92244e5648f2c","ja":"何か見たい番組ある？\nとりあえず、ニュースでも流しておく？","zh":"有什么想看的节目吗？\n要先放个新闻什么的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"6ec34d440ceb2ba0751fd6735ddd5cecbf1f19c93f04c0d7208bbea677b789f3","ja":"ピッ！","zh":"哔！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"a92f01b1aadb96d4134b2338825575e383c8f541000b0d66f5fcb10dbaa4de8a","ja":"「あなたに、とっておきの気持ちを伝えたい。\nあなたに、とっておきの気持ちを返したい……」","zh":"“想向你传达我珍藏的心意。\n想回应你珍藏的心意……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"7d904be434f94a4c3e6be0c67b9cf229a7ae707c873f68aa1f1e10594ddb1e71","ja":"バレンタインデーとホワイトデーを\nイメージしたCMでしょうか？","zh":"是以情人节和白色情人节为\n灵感的广告吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"5ef2575e7757f45a37883e424eb6ee7bc8a8bc7151318e8c0ea4510259ae9395","ja":"女の子も男の子も、みんなソワソワしちゃって\nかわいいわね～♪　この空気、懐かしいわ♪","zh":"女孩子们也好，男孩子们也好，都坐立不安的样子，\n真可爱呢～♪ 这种气氛，真让人怀念呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"02d46d7faa8d94d71581b3b7477508a41cd2e805884b290371ee0f18ce27feab","ja":"震えながらお菓子を渡すと、\n手と手が触れあってドキッ！　な～んて。","zh":"一边颤抖着递出点心，\n手与手触碰到的瞬间怦然心动！　开玩笑的啦～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"1c9c1e1d80c401a65604b0feaf948ede37e8859d8c9afdc61d8a66d35a3aa535","ja":"きゃ～♪　青春の1ページね！","zh":"呀～♪　是青春的第1页呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"6187015184e4fe2d8df7c329536f58d9fe535326a35f27579f15b1553138b6e3","ja":"そ、そういうものなんですね……。","zh":"这、原来是这样的啊……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"aad951598e77014fa7a0eaade796b2a1f53564dfa6510360db1dd730918ee34f","ja":"「今年のバレンタインとホワイトデーは一度きり。\n特別な贈り物で、最高の思い出を作りませんか？」","zh":"“今年的情人节与白色情人节仅此一次。\n要不要用特别的礼物，留下最美好的回忆呢？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"f1c206a18c7d3a5c251d8014a9a46735bd07ef81d789fe2aff8a8a19fd28635b","ja":"……やっぱり、誠意をもってお返しをするなら、\n特別な物がいいんでしょうか？","zh":"……果然，如果要带着诚意回礼的话，\n还是特别一点的东西比较好吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"0c5fc0dac623ebf30dacb588512c25c47c3fbd5512bd42ccfab822853e7b31fe","ja":"私、ちょっと迷っていて……。","zh":"我有点拿不定主意……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"b228df1ca4f4f05021f57fc9ade678b62bcc7af37d116dbac4918109b245998f","ja":"私も、ずっとお返しで悩んでいます。\n……困ったぞ。","zh":"我也一直在为回礼的事犯愁。\n……真伤脑筋啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1535.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"5817db457971f5b826d7c41426b3382d5d033ceacebc8cf5f502f50426385b55","ja":"えっ？　ふたりとも、どうしたの？\n悩みがあるなら、お姉さんが話を聞くわよ。","zh":"哎？你们两个怎么了？\n要是有什么烦恼的话，大姐姐可以听你们说哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
